# ✅ TaskFlow - Todo Application

A modern and responsive **Todo List Web Application** built using **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript**.

TaskFlow helps users organize their daily tasks, track their progress, set priorities, and manage tasks through a clean and modern dashboard interface.

## 🌐 Live Demo

[View TaskFlow Live](https://poojitha2155-rgb.github.io/Weather-App/)

---

## ✨ Features

- 📊 Modern dashboard with task statistics
- ➕ Create new tasks
- ✏️ Add task descriptions
- 🎯 Set task priority
  - Low
  - Medium
  - High
- 📅 Set due dates
- ✅ Mark tasks as completed
- 🗑️ Delete tasks
- 🔍 Search tasks
- 🔄 Filter tasks
  - All
  - Active
  - Completed
- 📈 Track task completion progress
- 💾 Persistent data using Local Storage
- 📱 Responsive design for desktop, tablet, and mobile
- 🎨 Modern and clean UI design
- ⚡ Fast and lightweight

---

## 🖥️ UI Overview

The application includes:

### Dashboard

The dashboard displays:

- Total tasks
- Completed tasks
- Pending tasks
- Overall progress

### Task Management

Users can:

1. Create a task
2. Add a description
3. Select priority
4. Set a due date
5. Mark the task as completed
6. Delete tasks

### Search & Filters

Tasks can be searched using the search bar and filtered based on their status.

