💾 Local Storage

TaskFlow uses the browser's LocalStorage API to save tasks.

This means your tasks remain available even after:

Refreshing the page
Closing the browser
Reopening the application
📱 Responsive Design

The application is designed to work across different screen sizes:

💻 Desktop
💻 Laptop
📱 Mobile
📱 Tablet
🎯 Project Goals

The main goal of this project is to build a practical task management application while demonstrating fundamental front-end development skills.

The project focuses on:

DOM manipulation
JavaScript event handling
Form handling
LocalStorage
Responsive CSS
UI/UX design
CRUD operations

